0..79 Comment "//! A view: a string held for a block is lent to a view for one access, and the"
80..156 Comment "//! view does not own it. The view reads the string it lends, and the access"
157..237 Comment "//! ends it exactly once: `resume` writes a string back, `abort` leaves the held"
238..317 Comment "//! string as it was and runs the access\'s `unwind` clause. The view lives only"
318..394 Comment "//! for its access, so no annotation names how long it lives (the yield-once"
395..470 Comment "//! accessor of Hylo\'s subscripts, [Racordon-2023-borrow_checking_hylo] and"
471..550 Comment "//! [boats-2024-references_are_jumps]). A view the program keeps longer is kept"
551..631 Comment "//! in the region of a scope around it, `at c`, and lives as long as that scope:"
632..679 Comment "//! a static extent erased before anything runs"
680..732 Comment "//! [Koronkevich-2025-type_universes_kripke_worlds]."
733..736 Comment "//!"
737..797 Comment "//! - cites: [Koronkevich-2025-type_universes_kripke_worlds]"
798..847 Comment "//! - cites: [Racordon-2023-borrow_checking_hylo]"
848..894 Comment "//! - cites: [boats-2024-references_are_jumps]"
895..898 Comment "//!"
